@@s080 At the exam
@@s081 At the exam
@@s082 Choose P2 from the catalogue by looking at the structure: independent nodes → Independent Set; cover of edges → Vertex Cover; path over all nodes → Hamiltonian; exact sum → Subset sum. Common mistake: confusing the direction of the reduction.
